<speak>Yes, she has made a shared office guide. I was doubtful at first because I thought everyone would ignore it, but she keeps it short and practical. There is a section for visitors, another for incoming documents, and a page showing who to contact for ordinary maintenance. She has even put photographs of the cupboards in it. I would never have thought of that, but the new staff find it much easier than reading a paragraph about the cupboard beside another cupboard.</speak>